      "id": 4334308,
      "name": "Etheric Phantom: Sobek",
      "desc": "When used, summons a phantom of <color=#FFAF2C>Sobek</color>, creating a wind field that pulls enemies within range. It deals DMG equal to <color=#2BAD00>100%</color>/<color=#2BAD00>30%</color>/<color=#2BAD00>10%</color> of Max HP to normal/elite/boss enemies, respectively. It also grants all Agents a shield equal to <color=#2BAD00>50%</color> of their Max HP for <color=#2BAD00>20</color>s. While the shield is active, Anti-Interrupt Level increases.",
